tions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hubwenbwen/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hubwenbwen/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hubwenbwen/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hubwenbwen/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":275,"digest":"sha256:636230d33cc588d16b2ed0afa6e87d20a550f79c1ed98a2c7bdf4885a7355d54","download_count":12,"created_at":"2026-10-11T08:30:37Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T08:30:38Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/hubwenbwen/ProtCell/releases/download/v1.0.0/SHA256SUMS"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hubwenbwen/ProtCell/tarball/v1.0.0","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hubwenbwen/ProtCell/zipball/v1.0.0","body":"# ProtCell v1.0.0\n\nThis release provides the pretrained ProtCell checkpoint and processed inputs for the five downstream notebooks.\n\n## Assets\n\n- `protcell_example_data.tar.gz`: the `results/data/` directory, including the study datasets, fixed Sparks2023 discovery/selection/test splits, discovery statistics and panel definitions.\n- `protcell_pretrained.pt`: the pretrained checkpoint loaded by the notebook setup cells.\n- `protcell_pretrained.json`: checkpoint provenance and SHA-256 checksum.\n- `SHA256SUMS`: checksums of the data archive, checkpoint and checkpoint metadata.\n\n## Use\n\nExtract the data archive from the repository root:\n\n```bash\ntar -xzf protcell_example_data.tar.gz\nmkdir -p checkpoints\nmv protcell_pretrained.pt protcell_pretrained.json checkpoints/\n```\n\nFollow the repository README to install the environment, then run the notebooks in `results/`. The data bundle contains already-preprocessed example inputs. `results/data/manifest.json` lists the individual files, studies, matrix shapes and checksums.\n"}